    diagnostic regression CF-037 was filed for, still reaching the operator through
    verify-node.sh. Same block writes /tmp/node-status.json, shared by every concurrent run.
    
    Every row carries a probe field with one paste-runnable command; this tick executed each
    row's exact probe string from the repo root before filing, and each reproduced the defect.
    
    Verified in this tree: scripts/boardctl validate -> RESULT: OK (13 warnings: the 10
    pre-existing ones plus the probe key on the three new rows, the accepted CF-060+ class);
    bash tests/selftest.sh -> SELFTEST: PASS. Diff is append-only: 3 insertions,
